---
description: TypeScript conventions for the orchestrator and local verification tools.
globs: tools/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

Use strict TypeScript and explicit types at SDK, process, filesystem, and JSON boundaries. Treat external JSON as unknown until validated. Imports of local modules use .ts; tsx runs source, and tsc checks without emitting JavaScript. Keep the Node toolchain out of iOS application targets.

Preserve gate exit classification, exact structured reports, and bounded repairs. Use fixture tests for scheduling or validation changes; run actual Xcode gates only against an authorized, configured app task.
